1. Description
The Outage Verification process is currently unable to remove the OPEN tag from switch equipment when its status changes to CLOSED.
This results in an incorrect representation of the switch's operational status within the topology network, potentially affecting connectivity tracing and outage verification results.
The logic needs to be corrected to ensure that the OPEN tag is removed when the switch status is CLOSED.
2. Change Description
Fixed an issue in the Outage Verification process where the OPEN tag was not removed when the switch status changed to CLOSED.
3. Change Details
Modified the Outage Verification logic to correctly update switch equipment tags based on their operational status.
When a switch is identified as CLOSED, the existing OPEN tag is removed to ensure accurate topology representation and connectivity tracing during outage verification
